Package: jaspGCEstim
Type: Package
Title: Entropy-Based Linear Regression for JASP
Version: 0.0.4
Authors@R: person("Jorge", "Cabral", email = "jorgecabral@ua.pt", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A JASP interface for weighted generalized cross-entropy linear
    regression using the GCEstim R package. This development version implements
    W-GCE, ridge-supported TARW-GCE, and standardized-support TASW-GCE with
    cross-validation, confidence intervals, plots, and saved model outputs.
